===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something [[homologous]]; a homologous organ or part, chemical compound or a chromosome.
# {{label|en|linguistics}} A word shared by two languages or dialects.
# {{label|en|genetics}} One of a group of similar DNA sequences that share a common ancestry.
# {{label|en|organic chemistry}} A member of a [[homologous series]]

